# Frontend & styling

Full design requirements: [ai/docs/design.md](mdc:ai/docs/design.md).

## React

- Relative imports within `src/`
- Server state via Wasp `useQuery`; actions with `async/await` (avoid `useAction` unless optimistic updates)
- Local UI state: `useState` / `useReducer`; light Context only for shell (nav, modals)

## Brand & layout

- Full-app background: `Design/BackgroundImage_Office.JPEG` (cover; fixed on desktop)
- Logo: `Design/Zaster_Master_Logo.svg` in header
- Content on **frosted/semi-opaque surfaces** — never small text on bare photo
- Header: logo + balance + icon nav only (no tab carousel, no income/expense in header)
- Einstellungen/Kategorien: edit category = subcategories + keywords (main and/or sub), not name-only
- Wire **IBM Plex Sans** as `font-sans` (see design.md); Lucide icons; German UI; desktop-primary

## UI kit & Tailwind

- Custom `zm-*` CSS tokens in `App.css` (design.md). Shadcn/Tailwind optional later — do not introduce a second system casually.
- No purple/indigo SaaS defaults; warm accent sparingly from the office mood
- Avoid inline `style` unless necessary (color swatches OK); amounts `de-DE` EUR with income/expense tokens
- Confidence colors: manual green · learned blue · keyword yellow · none gray
- Motion: nav active + page enter; keep calm
